        ],
        "bhavartha": "Śiva is anointed with the water of the Mandākinī, the heavenly Gaṅgā, and with sandal paste, and worshipped with mandāra flowers and many others. He is the Lord of Nandī, the master of the pramathas, the great Lord. The poet bows to Him as the sound ma, the second syllable of the prayer namaḥ śivāya."
      },
      "hi": {
        "lines": [
          [
            {
              "refs": [
                "w1"
              ],
              "text": "मन्दाकिनी (स्वर्ग-गंगा) के जल और चन्दन से जिनका लेपन हुआ है,"
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "refs": [
                "w2"
              ],
              "text": "जो नन्दी के स्वामी, प्रमथगणों के नाथ और महेश्वर हैं,"
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "refs": [
                "w3"
              ],
              "text": "मन्दार के फूलों और अनेक अन्य फूलों से जिनकी भली-भाँति पूजा हुई है,"
            }
          ],
          [
